(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[374]={"source_order":374,"notes":["The folio number is read as '187' followed by a superscript 'b'. The final character could alternatively be read as 'ᵇ' or as a '6'-like form; 'b' is the most likely reading.","Very faint marks were checked against the show-through pattern. None was identified as an independent pencil addition, but extremely faint pencil writing hidden beneath the show-through cannot be fully excluded.","Faint mirror-image show-through of the recto's catalogue entries (e.g. a reversed capitalised 'MAHABHARATA' heading at mid-page) is visible across the ruled lines. It is not writing on this page and is not inventoried as blocks.","A white binding thread visible beyond the right page edge is outside the page and is not a mark on the page.","Adjacent fol. 187 and fol. 188 are context only and are not transcribed.","The images were reviewed: the overview and all six native tiles, covering the top, middle, bottom, gutter and outer margins.","Apart from the folio number, the ruled page has no catalogue entries, headings or legible annotations.","Faint mirror-image show-through of the recto (fol. 187) is visible across the page. This includes a reversed capitalised 'MAHĀBHĀRATA' heading near mid-page and entry lines in the lower half. It is not writing on this page and is not transcribed.","Non-text marks have no legible text. They include: a grey smudge or rubbing trailing diagonally near the top centre (approx. [1770,610,540,530]); small specks and ticks at the gutter edge (approx. y 550, 2300, 2985); a dark spot near [865,2860]; a cluster of specks near [1225,3750]; a vertical row of specks near [2365,4255]; and a short diagonal scratch near the bottom edge [2400,4785].","A white binding thread lies beyond the right page edge and is not a mark on the page.","Extremely faint pencil writing hidden beneath the show-through cannot be completely excluded, but none was identified.","Edge terminology is inconsistent. The binding thread runs beyond the RIGHT edge, and the left edge shows the stacked edges of several leaves. The left edge is therefore probably the outer edge, not the gutter. The inventory and page_annotations call the left-edge specks (approx. y 560, 2300, 2990) 'gutter' marks. The speck near y 550 is actually at about x 565, not at the edge; there is a separate small tick at the left edge at about [330,540,25,40]. This affects only the description of non-text marks.","Some non-text marks are not inventoried. These are a small diagonal crease or mark at the top-right corner (approx. [3100,300,50,50]) and a broad faint grey shadow or rubbing in the upper right (approx. [2380,430,300,320]). Neither contains legible text.","The page annotation renders the reversed show-through heading as 'MAHĀBHĀRATA' with macrons. On this page the reversed letters are visible but the macrons are not securely discernible; the macronised form comes from the recto. This is show-through and is not transcribed."],"records":[{"id":"css-t1-0374-r001","local_id":"r001","source_order":374,"folio":"187b","folio_label":"fol. 187b","sequence":1,"page_id":"b00c271e-2555-4389-8104-c10ecf172d95","kind":"other","record_type":"non_catalogue_text","source_model_record_type":"non_catalogue_text","subtype":"folio_number","shelfmark":"","titleLiteral":"","titleNormalized":"","displayTitle":"Catalogue text","authorOrSource":"","source":"","subject":"","subjectGroup":"","date":"","extent":"","lines":"","script":"","incipit":"","transcription":"187ᵇ","annotations":["Folio number in the top-left corner, written as '187' with a raised 'b'.","The ink or pencil medium is not certain."],"uncertainties":["The raised final character is read as 'b'. It is written in a looped form that could be mistaken for a '6'. 'b' agrees with the supplied folio label 'fol. 187b'.","Edge terminology is inconsistent. The binding thread runs beyond the RIGHT edge, and the left edge shows the stacked edges of several leaves. The left edge is therefore probably the outer edge, not the gutter. The inventory and page_annotations call the left-edge specks (approx. y 560, 2300, 2990) 'gutter' marks. The speck near y 550 is actually at about x 565, not at the edge; there is a separate small tick at the left edge at about [330,540,25,40]. This affects only the description of non-text marks.","Some non-text marks are not inventoried. These are a small diagonal crease or mark at the top-right corner (approx. [3100,300,50,50]) and a broad faint grey shadow or rubbing in the upper right (approx. [2380,430,300,320]). Neither contains legible text.","The page annotation renders the reversed show-through heading as 'MAHĀBHĀRATA' with macrons. On this page the reversed letters are visible but the macrons are not securely discernible; the macronised form comes from the recto. This is show-through and is not transcribed."],"focused_readings":[],"reviewNotes":[],"editorialNotes":[],"relationships":[],"editorial_context":[],"block_ids":["b001"],"locations":[{"block_id":"b001","bbox":[365,300,150,160]}],"isCancelled":false,"needsReview":true,"human_verified":false,"verification_status":"machine_reviewed","change_audit":[],"sourceCitationURL":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/b00c271e-2555-4389-8104-c10ecf172d95.json","auditPath":"audit/pages/0374.json","attachedNotes":[],"resolvedRelationships":[],"attachedRecords":[]}]};
